description "Maris Brood

A fast, dual-wielding assassin with effective stealth and ambush skills.

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee
-- Applies Poison/Cripple/Force Focus
- Dual Guard Shotos (Dual Style Saber)
-- Short Length
-- Low Damage (85)
-- Saber Defense (2)
-- Blaster Defense (2)
-- Blaster Deflect (3)
-- Applies Pull, Stun, Cripple, and Force Focus
-- Saber Throw (3) ^3[CS1] (Deals 40 damage)

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Push (2)
- Pull (2)
- Speed (3)
- Mind Trick (3)
- Blind (1)
- Repulse (1) ^3[Melee CS1]

^8Attributes:
- Bunny Hop (1)
- Dexterity (3) ^3[CS2]
- Dash (1) ^3[CS3]
- Cloak (2) ^3[CS4]
- 60% Slower Cooldowns
- Force Block (1)
- Force Focus (3)
- Aerial Force Regen
- Sense Immunity

^3Abilities:
- Flipkick (1) ^3[Contact Jump]"